# LF everywhere, also on Windows checkouts: Biome formats with LF, and core.autocrlf=true would otherwise turn every
# file into CRLF and make `npm run lint` fail on a clean checkout (#56). templates/site keeps its own copy of this rule
# because each client repo starts from it.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.png binary
*.avif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.woff2 binary
